    'replacement-damage': {rootCause:'The customer report and advocate observation both document chip damage on card ending 1842. No replacement order exists yet, so fulfillment has not started.', confidence:'The physical condition is documented; replacement eligibility and processing outcome have not yet been established.', expectedOutcome:'Record the affected card and damage, then use the available replacement workflow if the customer requests replacement. Consider the case resolved only when an order reference and its resulting status are recorded.', caseNote:'Customer reports damage at the chip area of card ending 1842. The advocate observation records visible damage; no replacement request or order is present. Loss or theft has not been reported. The advocate has documented the condition but has not submitted an order.'},
